# Games (docs/GAMES.md): plays games for classic consoles on the built-in
# screen with libretro emulator cores, the same cores RetroArch uses.
NAME="Games"
SUMMARY="Play NES, Game Boy and GBA games (more consoles with downloadable cores)"
# Debian's libretro cores for NES (Nestopia), Game Boy / Color (Gambatte) and
# Game Boy Advance (mGBA); alsa-utils (aplay) for the sound; curl and unzip to
# download more cores (SNES, Mega Drive, PC Engine, PlayStation...) into
# ~/Games/cores from libretro's nightly builds, from the Games app.
DEPENDS="libretro-nestopia, libretro-gambatte, libretro-mgba, alsa-utils, curl, unzip"
